// Cardinality discipline ([CR#601.2d]): a RANGE target slot pushes a Many
// antecedent — the singular `That(Sort)` cannot read it (spell it `They` /
// `Them(Sort)`). Twin of Implicit.idr's `oneFromMany` failing block.
Normal(
  name: "Reject Singular Reads Range Slot",
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Targeted(
      targets: [Target(Between(1, 3), Creature)],
      effect: Destroy(That(Creature)),
    )),
  ],
)
